messages[36]{user,text}:
  user_2,Hello is this Ms Bhatt I hope you can hear me
  user_1,Yes speaking hi
  user_2,Great this is Anjali from First Guard Brokers calling about your DCoders home policy renewal
  user_1,Oh right I got your email earlier
  user_2,Just wanted to confirm the expiry date and go over the bundle options we sent
  user_1,Sure uh when does it actually end
  user_2,Your current home policy #H‑4521 expires on 30/10/2026
  user_1,Got it and the motor options
  user_2,We have two motor plans Plan A covers up to ₹10 Lakhs with a 5% deductible Plan B up to ₹20 Lakhs with a 3% deductible Both get a 10% discount when bundled with home
  user_1,Hmm I need to check my car's value can you hold
  user_2,Sure I’ll place you on hold for a sec
  user_2,[hold music]
  user_2,[typing]
  user_2,Okay thanks for waiting
  user_1,Sorry about that my dog just barked
  user_2,No worries! So which plan sounds better for you
  user_1,I think Plan B might be overkill but I'm not sure
  user_2,We can also customise the deductible if you like
  user_1,Umm could you tell me the premium difference
  user_2,Sure with the 4% increase on home alone it's ₹12 000 per year Adding Plan A brings it to ₹15 500 Plan B to ₹17 800 after the 10% bundle discount
  user_1,Okay that's a bit higher than I expected
  user_2,I understand we could also look at a no claim bonus if you haven't filed any claims
  user_1,I haven't filed any so that would help
  user_2,That would shave off another 5% on the combined premium
  user_1,Great so what would the final amount be
  user_2,Let me run the numbers [typing]
  user_2,[hold music]
  user_2,All set With Plan A and the no claim bonus you'd pay around ₹14 700 yearly With Plan B about ₹16 800
  user_1,Hmm maybe I’ll go with Plan A then
  user_2,Perfect I’ll send you the updated quote by email right after this call
  user_1,Thanks Anjali Oh one more thing can I still pay in monthly installments
  user_2,Yes we offer monthly quarterly or annual payments Monthly would be ₹1 225 after discount
  user_1,Alright let's do monthly then
  user_2,Got it I’ll set that up and you’ll receive a confirmation email shortly
  user_1,Thanks a lot Bye
  user_2,Thank you Ms Bhatt Have a great day